===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la}} {{term|lang=la|eruditio||an instructing, learning, erudition}}<!--Or "erudition"?-->, from {{term|lang=la|erudire||to instruct, educate, cultivate|lit=free from rudeness}}, from {{term|lang=la|e||out}} + {{term|lang=la|rudis||rude}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# [[profound|Profound]] [[knowledge]], especially that based on [[learning]] and [[scholarship]].

